Package: ImmuneAgeStability
Title: An Rpackage to retrieve age stability information for immune response gene signatures 
Version: 0.0.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Leon", "Bichmann","leon.bichmann@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: ImmuneAgeStability is a lightweight R package to easily retrieve age stability information on immune response gene signatures. The information is based on subject variance computed across a large cohort of nicaraguan children on bulk and single cell RNAseq expression values. 
License: `use_mit_license()`
